SUMMARY:Fit4Mom Yoga Night
DESCRIPTION:Yoga & Wine at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis Wednesday\, June 10 | 6–8 PM Held the Second Wednesday of Every Month\nTicket Includes: First Glass of Wine & Yoga Class\nWhat could be better than yoga in the vineyard followed by a glass of wine? Join us for a relaxing summer evening as FIT4MOM Davis-Woodland and Great Bear Vineyards team up to bring you the perfect blend of movement\, mindfulness\, and wine.\n Surrounded by vineyard views and blooming lavender\, talented FIT4MOM instructors will lead an easy-to-moderate Vinyasa flow set to groovy tunes and tailored to your skill level. Whether you’re a seasoned yogi or trying yoga for the first time\, this welcoming class is designed for everyone.\n As the practice winds down\, you’ll be guided through an inspirational original meditation\, leaving you feeling refreshed\, grounded\, and ready to enjoy the rest of your evening.\n Then it’s time to relax! Enjoy your included glass of Great Bear wine while strolling through the lavender fields\, setting up a picnic with friends\, or simply soaking in the peaceful vineyard atmosphere.\nA little movement\, a little mindfulness\, and a little wine—the ingredients for a perfect summer evening.\n What to Bring Yoga mat Towel Water bottle Food items for a picnic (optional) Light jacket or sweater for the evening Money/card if you’d like to purchase additional wine by the glass or bottle\n Ticket Includes Yoga class led by FIT4MOM Davis-Woodland Your first glass of Great Bear wine Access to a beautiful evening in the vineyard\nGather your friends\, roll out your mat\, and join us for an evening of wellness\, connection\, and wine. We can’t wait to see you in the vineyard! \nHosted by FIT4MOM Davis-Woodland 925-285-6514
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/fit4mom-yoga-night/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards  24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
